; policy_agent.aura - Aura-native control plane (no FFI soup)
;
; Split architecture (see docs/aura-native-control.md):
;   C aura_redis_server  = data plane (GET/SET + EVICT/LAYOUT/INFO kernels)
;   this process         = policy workspace: hot-strategy mutate choose-fn,
;                          apply via RESP EVICT / LAYOUT
;
; Why separate process: on this Aura rev, many top-level c-func binds make
; user closures inert - so hot-strategy must live in a fresh workspace.
;
; Env:
;   AURA_REDIS_PORT          target C server (default 6379)
;   AURA_REDIS_HOST          default 127.0.0.1
;   AURA_REDIS_POLICY_DEMO=1 timed swap+heal demo then exit
;   AURA_REDIS_POLICY_MS     tick period (default 200)
;   AURA_REDIS_POLICY_PROFILE_FILE  path whose contents name a choose body
;                                   (normal|aggressive|conservative|inverted|broken);
;                                   on change, hot-strategy:swap! (demo-mvp invert/heal)
;   AURA_REDIS_FITNESS_MUTATE=0|1   fitness-driven hot-strategy profile swap/heal
;                                   (default 1). Set 0 or AURA_REDIS_FROZEN=1 to freeze
;                                   choose-fn after seed (adaptive_frozen bench).
;   AURA_REDIS_SEED_PROFILE         initial body after register (default normal)
;   AURA_REDIS_EVOLVE=0|1           M11 slow online evolve loop (multi-gen threshold
;                                   mutate + fitness window + keep/revert). Distinct
;                                   from M7 one-shot fitness-threshold-mutate.
;   AURA_REDIS_THRESH_MIN_OPS       seed min-ops literal (default 40; evolve uses 180)
;   AURA_REDIS_THRESH_MISS_PIN      seed miss-pin literal (default 30; evolve uses 75)
;   AURA_REDIS_EVOLVE_MAX_GENS      max generations (default 6)
;   AURA_REDIS_EVOLVE_WINDOW        ticks per fitness window (default 8)
;   AURA_REDIS_PASSWORD / REQUIREPASS  AUTH to C server when requirepass set
;   AURA_REDIS_POLICY_HEARTBEAT     optional file rewritten each tick (HA probe)
;   AURA_REDIS_POLICY_FORCE_RECONNECT_AFTER  test hook: drop TCP after N ticks
;   AURA_REDIS_POLICY_BACKOFF_CAP_MS  reconnect backoff cap (default 4000)
;   AURA_REDIS_CANARY=0|1            A4: trial choose-fn N ticks then commit/heal
;   AURA_REDIS_CANARY_TICKS          trial window ticks (default 5)
;   AURA_REDIS_CANARY_INJECT         start one canary trial of named profile
;                                   (broken|inverted|aggressive|…) after warm-up
;   AURA_REDIS_CANARY_DROP_PP        EWMA drop vs baseline to heal (default 12)

(require "std/mutate" all:)
(require "std/hot-strategy" all:)
(require "std/socket" all:)
